      "matchText": "Tokugawa unification",
      "term": "Tokugawa unification",
      "definition": "The consolidation of warring Japan under Tokugawa Ieyasu after his victory at Sekigahara in 1600, ending a century of civil war and founding the Edo shogunate that ruled until 1868."
